      "terrain": "a steep hillside carved into stepped rice paddy terraces, rising to a high ridge",
      "icons": "a great bronze temple bell in an open-sided timber belfry pavilion on the ridge above; flooded terrace paddies stepped down the hillside; machiya farmsteads with dark timber framing; stone lanterns along the stepped lanes",
      "infra": "stone_retaining_wall along the terraces; stone_stair paths climbing between the paddies up to the ridge"
